<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-19T04:59:02.653Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian-backed militias in Iraq suffered a mysterious explosion that struck a group linked to Iran, and the Popular Mobilization Forces confirmed Al-Fayyadh remains chairman despite disputed vice-presidency claims. Iran’s envoy in Baghdad warned that the security of Iran-Iraq borders is Tehran’s red line, and Iranian forces attacked the Komala Kurdish opposition group in Iraq. In northern Iraq a power struggle in Nineveh delayed Sinjar administrative appointments, while the Kurdistan Regional Government warned that a coalition exit could enable an ISIS resurgence. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOS2FFRENGemo3SWp4aUZfXzNwZFRTOExUcXAzc2hULTN6QldoTmFBd2NpUU45UHY2bXpLZGpWWS1lMWstMXFmeGhNY0pScnJSY0dUSDZLT1VQZjF2bGd3ci02VTBYNl81NFl2cXVuSVhFdXU2ai0yYmtSNVozRnI0NF9wY19IY0VxNk5BZ2hBX0JGZXMwMmxnNHBIX1R3NFF2cl9ESXpaTXk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iraqi News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE43YVlwckV4N2h0YktDalJGaDJJLXdmdHpWNklsMXhZRzRGbmhrRTFUb081V1FKYXJRREJZMEhsM05hYlNZNDJvemJXWEh3TU9ESEh5NTVSRG9SbDlfU2xYcTdtVjRvdFg0Z3JrSFV0SlJFOWhXSERDeUhvdm5GQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;U.S. Embassy &amp;amp; Consulate in Iraq (.gov)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQYktUd054d0RNMzdERGxDekhPU0dpQWRPRVFDNGhaRXByRElZT2xsbjVyV1lxVHEtSW5mSUJIYWxuc3ZiQW1FdmdTaS13OWRoQnllZWsyYU90QVotVV9Cc01SXzRtVjVVNjdhMGw4cGRvbVAtOG1tTUQ3QzE1NjhBR0FDTmU0U3czekJ5UmJiTGU?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE1EX3M5LUxaSEVVUUVxcWowSlFjZXhRLW5yLVZON3MycERKQjczMDUxY0xjR2xaMTR2S2toVnduaTZJQjQ5UE5IdUZrVURzb3BnUWRz?oc=5&quot;&gt;PUKmedia یەکێتیی نیشتمانیی کوردستان&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/a